      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OUR MONARCH (5) worked to get to the lead and kept trying only to find one better on debut last time out over 2190m at this track, beaten just a nose as the $1.55 favourite. Meets a similar line up and racing fitter should prove hard to beat. CRUEL MISTRESS (7) has been racing well having placed in all of her last three runs, including a second most recently at this track over 1790m after racing in behind the leader at the bell. Drawn to enjoy a soft trip in the running but might need things to go her way at some stage. Meets a similar line up so she is capable of continuing her fine form. BETTY CAROLINE (2) must be considered after she finished runner-up over 1790m at this track five days ago after racing outside the leader at the bell. Having her third career run and looks a leading chance. SANTA CASA LEVI (3) is the best of the rest after finishing fifth over 1790m at this track last time out. Worth including in combinations for value.",
